flowchart TD
  C["Client request"] --> L["Leader: pre-prepare<br/>assigns an order"]
  L --> P["Prepare: replicas broadcast<br/>that they saw it"]
  P --> M["Commit: once 2f+1 agree"]
  M --> R["Reply to the client"]
  N["n agents, at most f faulty<br/>needs f &lt; n/3"] -.-> M
  W["LLM variants: weight votes by<br/>confidence (CP-WBFT), go leaderless"] -.-> M
